  "_about": "U SPORTS men's basketball. CONFERENCES (the four blocks, and so which games are conference games) from masseyratings.com's conference pages (https://masseyratings.com/cb/u-sports/ratings?c=1), captured 2026-09-23, identical for 2025-26 and 2026-27 - and identical club for club to U SPORTS' own 2025-26 standings (https://en.usports.ca/sports/mbkb/2025-26/standings). DIVISIONS from U SPORTS' own standings: Canada West Pacific / Prairie, OUA Central / East / West, AUS and RSEQ undivided. masseyratings' own sub-groups (OUA East/West of 9, AUS Baldwin/Nelson) are not the league's and are not used; their names are kept as spellings. The 2026-27 standings page was not yet populated on 2026-09-23 - check the divisions again once it is. Bare nicknames two universities share (Cougars, Huskies, Thunderbirds) are deliberately absent. Each club is listed with every spelling a feed or ratings site uses, the first being the reader's name; names are matched folded. A conference game is a game between two clubs of the same conference in the regular season - divisions only split the table. A new season with different membership gets its own block under seasons. See scripts/ingest/groups.py and docs/conferences.md.",
